(* SANITY-CHECK CONNECTION TO r_e (heuristic, not derivation):                *)
(*   If Λ is identified with the inverse bound-state cutoff radius via       *)
(*   Λ = hbar/r_e c (Compton-like), then Log(Λ²/m²) = -2 Log(r_e m c/ħ) =     *)
(*   -2 Log(r_e/λ_C) where λ_C = ħ/(mc).  Using r_0 = α λ_C:                  *)
(*     Log(Λ²/m²) = -2 Log((r_e/r_0) · α).                                    *)
(*   Setting (r_e/r_0) ≈ 1/2 gives Log(Λ²/m²) ≈ -2 Log(α/2) ≈ 11.23.          *)
(*   Then δm/m ≈ (3α/(4π)) · (11.23 + 0.5) ≈ 2.04e-2.                         *)
(*   The natural one-loop coupling α/(4π) ≈ 5.81e-4; the heuristic δm/m sits *)
